WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.130
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:33.650
Dishes of Chinese cuisine

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:36.110
are as different as stars.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:38.610
Now the amazing Chinese cuisine

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:39.520
has spread around

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:41.010
the world.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:42.680
(Beijing)

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.370
With a history of 4,000 years, Chinese cuisine

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:46.530
(Shanghai)
has been divided into four major parts.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.740
In the end, it has made unprecedented achievements

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.010
(Guangdong)
and reached its peak.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:51.890
At that time, there was

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:54.890
(Sichuan)
intense competition between several brilliant chefs.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.820
It can also be called

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:58.520
Sengoku period of Chinese cuisine.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:00.920
The time is the 19th century

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.290
which is an unsettled period of the late Qing dynasty.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.390
2,000 kilometers away from the southeast of

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.260
the capital Beijing,

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:10.510
the \"Land of Plenty\"

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:12.210
at the source of the Yangtze River benefits from
the natural environment.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:15.250
A new legendary chef

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.330
in the history of Chinese cuisine

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.220
was born in a town of Sichuan Province.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.530
Genius Cooking Boy Mao

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:38.230
Great. I found them.

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:40.230
These shiitake mushrooms with special flavor

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.830
are the best ingredients.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:52.330
Terrific!

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.370
That kid often goes out

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:18.390
during the busiest time of our restaurant.

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:19.620
Is Mao looking for

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.950
ingredients in the mountains?

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:22.870
Sounds great.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.220
But I think he's just slacking off

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.620
on playing everywhere.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:26.620
This restaurant

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:27.610
relies on my brother and me now.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.510
I'm worried that we don't know
what to do with our future.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.010
It's really so hard.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:32.370
You're not young anymore.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.160
It's time for you to get married.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.620
You don't have to worry about that.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:41.650
But

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.620
Head Chef Pai also passed away.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:44.860
About a month ago.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:45.430
Yes.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.310
Luckily, our regular customers still come here often.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:48.620
We've also made up our mind

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.090
to stick to the flavor of my mother's previous cuisine.

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:52.330
All regular customers come here

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:53.080
because they can't forget

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.510
the flavor of Chef Pai's cuisine.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.900
After my father died eleven years ago,

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.490
my mother inherited this restaurant.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:00.420
As the head chef,

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:01.840
she kept this Chrysanthemum Tower running.

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.120
Her cooking skills have been widely praised.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:04.070
She was called Fairy Chef of Sichuan.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.400
She was a rare famous chef

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:06.480
in history.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:10.070
Different kinds of elaborate dishes that
my mother created

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.490
keep changing

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.700
the history of this restaurant.

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:13.880
Finally, she made it one of the best

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:15.380
state-owned restaurants of Sichuan Province.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.580
The good reputation of Chrysanthemum Tower
has also spread nationwide.

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.830
Thank you for coming.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.740
So delicious.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.730
What's wrong with you?

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:35.930
Watch out!

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:57.630
Thanks for coming.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.300
You can bring me any dishes.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.600
Just take out all delicious dishes

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.240
if there is something delicious

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.830
in your restaurant.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.980
I'm definitely right, Miss Keling.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:09.350
Those weirdos outside

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.460
will definitely claim that your dishes are not good.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:12.720
Then they'll take the chance to
make trouble and ask for money.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.720
They must be gangsters who come from somewhere
and want to pick on us.

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:16.770
Shunxin, what should we do now?

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.310
I'll handle it.

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:19.950
I'm Chef Pai's student.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.270
I'll try my best to

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.110
cook dishes they cannot find fault with.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.050
Wait and see, guys.

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.980
Am I clear?

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:30.020
Yes.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.910
Please have a taste.

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:44.010
Didn't you understand what I mean?

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:47.640
I meant bring me delicious dishes.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:49.620
But you brought me feed for the pigs.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.470
What do you want to do?

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.260
What do you want to do?

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:16.840
Keling!

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:22.850
I got a lot of...

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:26.050
Keling.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.340
Precious wild vegetables

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:28.210
and shiitake mushrooms.

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:31.150
Look. I got so many things.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.960
Keling, what happened?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.250
Who are those guys?

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.800
They claimed dishes of our restaurant

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:45.700
taste horrible.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.510
I just spoke the truth.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:49.010
Are you kidding me?

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:50.370
You judged the taste by only

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:51.570
taking a sip of the soup?

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.090
You've been trying to pick on us

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:54.980
in our restaurant from the beginning, right?

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.740
Yes, it must be like that.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.150
If I take a sip

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.260
but fail to know the taste,

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:05.500
how can I be a so-called top chef?

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:07.670
Top chef?

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.010
But even so,

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.180
you have no right

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:11.940
to mess up our restaurant.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.630
I do have the right.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:16.850
Look at this.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:18.910
Provincial Military Commander Li, the leader of

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.700
Chinese Cooking Society issued this letter of appointment

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.430
to me which declares that I'm the new head chef.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.650
That means this restaurant is already mine.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:26.760
I can't believe it.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:28.330
Provincial Military Commander Li appointed

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.380
an unknown man as chef.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:32.290
You said I'm unknown?

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.110
Have you already forgotten

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.170
me?

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:40.830
This scald.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.360
Are you

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:43.540
Shaoan?

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:44.730
It's you?

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.330
You finally remember me.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.300
I had been working hard

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:48.740
in this restaurant for ten years.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.040
You're really heartless.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:52.340
I've never forgotten

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:53.790
what happened before.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.130
Shaoan,

00:07:58.730 --> 00:07:59.230
you can't

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:00.900
boil up the food completely like that.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.060
You need to be more careful.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:03.960
You're so annoying, hag!

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.380
You've said the same thing again and again.
When will you stop?

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:09.720
I've learned all your culinary skills.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:10.630
I don't need

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.150
your instruction anymore, hag.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.970
Even if you've already learned my culinary skills secretly,

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.830
you still can't copy the taste of my dishes.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.360
As long as you don't understand it,

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:20.130
you can never become a chef

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.320
who is able to

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:22.930
take charge of the kitchen alone.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.360
You need to figure it out thoroughly, Shaoan.

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:26.520
Shut up!

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:29.220
Don't always treat me like a child!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.170
Stupid hag!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:36.870
Shaoan, are you okay?

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:38.240
You need to deal with it immediately.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.700
You're so annoying.
I don't wanna stay in this restaurant anymore!

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:41.290
Shaoan!

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.900
Because of the scald on my face,

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:46.970
I faced so many humiliations.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.200
You definitely can't imagine that.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.650
However, I endured every humiliation.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.110
I kept improving my cooking skills.

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.450
Finally, I earned the qualification for the top chef.

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:04.690
It was the idea of destroying Chrysanthemum Tower

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:06.630
that supported me.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:07.450
You're way too much!

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.900
Your idea is too extreme!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.620
In order to train her student well,

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:12.780
my mother tried her best to teach you cooking skills.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:14.700
Even before she died,

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.100
she was always worried about you.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.110
She wondered how you were doing.

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:18.320
Anyway,

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:20.730
Fairy Chef of Sichuan is already dead.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.280
I'm the new head chef of Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:25.810
Stop!

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:26.910
Go away, kid.

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:33.760
Let me go!

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:39.420
Crap.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:40.430
I won't let him

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.030
take away Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.400
Terrible kid!

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:44.880
Stop.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:46.490
Step aside, everyone.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:49.360
Provincial Military Commander Li is here!

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.770
That man is Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.620
Oh, he's Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:56.880
Your excellency, Provincial Military Commander.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.030
I was appointed

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.820
as head of Chrysanthemum Tower by you.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.710
I'm Shaoan.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:03.520
It's all over now.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.510
Mother's restaurant is over.

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:08.520
You're Shaoan?

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:09.270
Yes.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:11.820
Looks like you misunderstood what I meant.

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.830
Before I judge cooking skills of all chefs,

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:17.790
how could I appoint you as

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:18.900
head chef of a state-owned restaurant?

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.640
It's such an important post.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:22.700
I must stamp my name

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.050
on that letter of appointment

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.480
to appoint you as

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:27.730
new head chef of Chrysanthemum Tower officially.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.150
Provincial Military Commander, you mean...

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:32.340
I can't decide if I want to appoint you

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:34.260
as new head chef officially before I taste

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:35.440
your dish.

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:36.570
I got it.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:38.150
Then may I ask

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:39.420
which dish do you want to taste?

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:40.150
Well,

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.850
I'd like to taste fried rice.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.140
Fried rice?

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:45.220
I see.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:46.660
Fried rice is

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.550
the foundation of basic dishes of Chinese cuisine.

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:49.360
And it can show

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:51.590
chefs' cooking skills clearly.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:53.160
Provincial Military Commander Li is so great.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.410
Amazing.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.830
But why does he use three iron pots?

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:08.980
And he wants to boil that pot of soup.

00:11:09.090 --> 00:11:10.290
What on earth does he want to do?

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.810
Even if he wants to season the fried rice,

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.440
the most important fresh and tasty flavor

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:17.140
of the fried rice will be destroyed.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.350
You will not get it.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:23.670
What on earth does he want to do?

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:27.960
Take good advantage of flavors of world's delicacies

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.660
to amaze even the rich people who

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:31.860
live a luxurious lifestyle.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.140
This is top chef Shaoan's

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.220
amazing skill!

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:43.810
Mix the fired ingredients with soup

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.890
and combine them with fried rice in the end.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.020
What kind of fried rice is that?

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.920
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:09.850
It's coming.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:36.570
The fishy smell of seafood

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.600
including shrimps, crabs and shark fins.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.760
There should be a fishy smell.

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:42.800
But how did he deal with it?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:44.690
This dish of fried rice

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.100
has combined ingredients from the mountains and the sea.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.720
Fried rice was supposed to be the commonest dish.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.400
I didn't expect that he could turn it into

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.600
such a luxurious and substantial delicacy.

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:04.040
It's really amazing.

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:06.130
The dish of Shaoan who's the so-called

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.270
No.1 student of Chef Pai is so good.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:11.750
Excuse me, Provincial Military Commander.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:13.280
Please pardon my ignorance,

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:14.530
but I think

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.270
my cooking skill

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.380
is already better than that of Chef Pai.

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:18.960
Better than my mother?

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:21.480
Well, please stamp your name on it.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:24.100
Wait! I also want to taste it.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:25.260
Go away, kid!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:26.980
Mao!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.560
It hurts! Let me go!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:47.650
Delicious!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.430
All kinds of strong fishy smells of seafood

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:53.570
are gone.

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:54.870
But the tastiness of seafood

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:57.220
still stays in this dish of fried rice.

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:00.010
I can feel that

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:03.460
there is a very special flavor.

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:07.190
I got it.

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:07.960
That's it.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:10.240
He used

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:12.460
the coriander which is used for salting Jinhua hams.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.230
Kid.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:14.520
It's the coriander.

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:20.740
But... Well,

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:21.830
this dish of fried rice

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:25.940
definitely cannot surpass my mother's dish.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.170
Even if you're Chef Pai's son,

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.650
you're still a kid.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.390
Kids are ignorant.

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:41.260
Since I was born,

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.450
my mother's kitchen

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.770
has always been my playground.

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:45.720
My body

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:47.420
has been covered with flavors of my mother's dishes.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.220
So I'm sure that

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:52.120
my mother's fried rice tastes better.

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:52.880
Shut up!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:54.860
Provincial Military Commander,

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.630
please don't listen to him.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.390
The memory of a child

00:14:58.480 --> 00:14:59.920
cannot prove anything.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.250
Actually, Chef Pai is already dead.

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:03.920
And her fried rice

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:05.180
will not appear in the world again.

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:07.390
It's totally impossible to

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:09.080
compare her fried rice with mine.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.920
But if anyone can let fired rice

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.700
of Chef Pai appear again,

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:16.420
I'll be okay with that.

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:21.800
I can do it.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.080
What?

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:24.660
Provincial Military Commander Li,

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.610
please give me a chance

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:27.770
to cook my mother's fried rice.

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.670
What did you say?

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:30.850
You fool around every day.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.050
You never put effort into learning cooking.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:38.590
Let me make it clear first.

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:41.280
Dishes of state-owned restaurants

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.180
can represent the quintessence of
the 4000-year Chinese cuisine.

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:43.600
What's more,

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:45.190
I can even say that

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:46.380
they're closely related to the prestige of our country.

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:47.620
That means

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.880
if you cook something horrible,

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.270
it'll be a serious crime of you.

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:53.510
Even if you're still a kid,

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:54.630
I won't forgive you.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:56.830
Did you say that after you

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.850
mentally prepared yourself?

00:15:58.110 --> 00:15:58.540
Yes.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:01.330
I'll let my mother's fried rice

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.050
appear again in front of everyone.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:20.480
First, fry the eggs.

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:21.920
I must whisk them thoroughly and rapidly.

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:22.950
When they're half-boiled,

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:23.880
add rice.

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.750
Fry the rice until all grains are separated.

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:28.680
Then mix the rice with eggs gently.

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:31.260
After the rice has been mixed well with eggs,

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.640
season the dish with salt and black pepper.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:34.480
Retain flavors

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:36.360
and fragrances of all ingredients in a flash.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:39.900
That's the fire dish

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:41.160
which is the essence of Chinese cuisine.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.360
OK. I'm done.

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:54.360
The dish cooked by this kid

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:55.840
is just a joke.

00:16:59.050 --> 00:16:59.960
Mao is stupid.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:01.370
Why did he boast?

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:02.190
Well,

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:04.180
it's totally impossible for the fried rice
which only contains

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:05.700
some vegetables and eggs to win.

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:12.460
Provincial Military Commander Li,

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:14.540
please have a taste now.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.930
What are those rays of light?

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:24.690
Is it really the fried rice?

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.300
That fried rice...

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:48.000
Is it the golden fried rice?

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:49.340
Yes.

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:51.400
Golden fried rice?

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:53.590
I think I've seen some light.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:54.920
But it's unbelievable.

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.380
Golden fried rice

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:58.410
sounds great.

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:00.470
But in a word, it just contains more eggs.

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.230
It's no big deal.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.210
It's just a dish of fried rice.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.270
Guys, you don't need to be surprised.

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:13.250
What exactly does he think of it?

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.410
It's over now.

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:16.560
I know it.

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:29.700
That's it.

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:32.620
It's the fried rice of Chef Pai.

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:35.190
Impossible.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.220
It's totally impossible.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:37.390
Right.

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:39.750
Golden fried rice just mixed rice

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.080
with eggs.

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:44.250
But all grains of rice

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.690
must be mixed well with eggs.

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:47.840
Only in this way

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.940
can it shines like the gold.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:52.710
In Sichuan,

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:54.010
only Chef Pai

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:56.440
can make this golden fried rice.

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.810
I didn't expect that a 13-year-old teenager

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.270
can make a dish exactly the same as it.

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.940
Compared with Shaoan's

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.030
luxurious and substantial fried rice,

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:06.310
it's still very good, honestly.

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:07.630
Provincial Military Commander Li.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.720
So great!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.520
Excuse me, Provincial Military Commander.

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.270
My dishes

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:24.960
have been praised by countless gourmets.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:26.530
But today,

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:29.160
I received the same review as a teenager’s.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.330
I remember that you were

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:32.020
a royal chef of the imperial palace before.

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:33.530
I can't believe you said that.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:36.750
Since you said that,

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:37.690
Provincial Military Commander,

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.110
as a top chef,

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.220
I have to preserve my dignity.

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:41.460
Please allow me to compete

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.690
with Mao officially.

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:44.950
I mean the State-owned Restaurant Cooking Competition

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:47.380
which has been recognized by

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:49.060
Chef Association of Sichuan Province.

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:52.390
I hope you can issue a permit for me.

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:54.130
That's the

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:54.990
State-owned Restaurant Cooking Competition

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.850
which was held in every ten years before.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:00.400
It is said that if someone loses this kind of competition,

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:02.620
his career as a chef will end.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:05.090
It's the most serious competition

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.620
of Chinese cooking society.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:07.880
I think you know

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:10.840
the rules of the State-owned Restaurant Cooking Competition.

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:12.870
If you lose in the end,

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.080
Mao will be

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.560
the new head chef of Chrysanthemum Tower

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:17.690
and your current chef license

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.360
will be canceled.

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:22.470
It's not gonna happen unless

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:23.290
there is a miracle.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:24.920
My opponent is just a kid.

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.530
I don't need to get worried.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:28.150
I also hope I can take part in this competition.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:29.960
Provincial Military Commander Li,
please allow Shaoan and me

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:31.090
to join the cooking competition.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:33.720
Mao, if you lose,

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:35.080
you'll be accused of

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:37.380
insulting a top chef.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:38.840
It cannot be fixed even if you and all staff members

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:39.860
of this restaurant leave.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:40.600
Right.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:42.490
I've mentally prepared for

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:43.920
every punishment.

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.850
What? Really?

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:47.690
It's a competition for

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.740
the new head chef post of Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:51.340
It'll be exciting.

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:52.800
Such a stupid kid.

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:55.400
He made a decision without discussing it with me.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:58.030
But what's the theme?

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:59.330
If it's a very difficult theme,

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:01.180
it'll be impossible for our Mao to win.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.550
Now I'm gonna announce the theme of the competition.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:07.100
Shaoan, Mao.

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:09.040
I want you to

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:10.970
compete with each other on Mapo tofu.

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:14.770
Great! I can make Mapo tofu as well!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.630
But it's not the normal Mapo tofu.

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:18.340
I want you to make

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:19.440
the Mystery Mapo Tofu.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:21.460
Mystery?

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:23.600
Authentic Sichuan cuisine

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:29.200
needs to be spicy, fragrant, colorful, hot and numbing.

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:30.860
Merge the five flavors into one.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:32.830
A dish that contains the five flavors is
the best dish of Sichuan cuisine.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:34.970
However, the Mystery Mapo Tofu

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.390
contains six flavors.

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:38.270
Contain six flavors?

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:40.980
Absolutely right.

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:43.870
The Mystery Mapo Tofu which contains six flavors

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:45.740
is the theme of this competition.

00:21:46.350 --> 00:21:47.360
It should contain an extra flavor

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:48.470
besides the five flavors.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:50.000
What on earth is that flavor?

00:23:14.851 --> 00:23:18.355
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.355 --> 00:23:22.233
We're going to have a formal cooking competition for
the position of the head chef.

00:23:22.233 --> 00:23:25.361
But I've never heard of Mapo tofu
with the unity of six flavors.

00:23:25.361 --> 00:23:28.115
What the hell is the last flavor?

00:23:28.739 --> 00:23:30.605
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:30.605 --> 00:23:32.610
The Mystery Mapo Tofu Confrontation

00:23:32.702 --> 00:23:34.078
It will definitely be delicious!
